{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/20/0865837/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、Skyrocket Company にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘書をさせて頂きました！キリッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聞いてくれたかな？ヽ(｡･c_，･｡)ﾉﾞ イエイイエイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧も、沢山の方がきてくれて嬉しかった！一人で緊張したけど、みなさんの顔を見るとホッとできたよー(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで、やしろ教頭ーーーーーーっ(｡> <｡)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぉぉぉぉおおおおー(白目)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生のとき、やしろさんのラジオ番組の企画があり、それがこの世界を目指すきっかけになったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の私がいるのもやしろさんの、いや、やしろ教頭のおかげであったり(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからリスナーだった、中学時代のさゆちゃんってラジオネームで呼んでもらっちゃいましたヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか中学生かぁーヽ(^ω^)ﾉ懐ッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃は毎日夜遅くまで塾に通ってたなーヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その帰り道いつもラジオ聞いてヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかそのラジオのパーソナリティだった、やしろさんと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今お仕事できるとは(@_@)夢のようです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生わからないもんですねぇー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃よりは成長した！かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/20/0865837/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どあっぷ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、こんなに手が震えることがあるかってくらい、緊張した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしいつもフワ～っと全然緊張しない人間だから、自分でもびっくりしたよ(´^ω^`;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、教頭が目の前に...ふあわわわ(白目)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、本当に楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘書の座をめぐって、浜崎美保さんとバトルを... ということだったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浜崎さん、すごく優しくって、音声では伝わらないけど、見えないところで沢山フォローをしてくださいました(´°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥ω°̥̥̥̥̥̥̥̥｀)有難き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やしろさん、浜崎さん、そしてみなさん、有難うございました┗(^o^ )┓<33"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このラジオ一生の宝にします(＾ω＾)(＾ω＾)(＾ω＾)(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から撮影をしてるぜ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/20/0865837/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むむむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/20/0865837/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もふもふッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ"}],"source":"archive"}